      "updated": 1789839161
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaec76c0000000000fe0521",
      "text": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Irradiation_illusion",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789839213,
      "updated": 1789839217
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaec78e0000000000fe0522",
      "text": "> [Galileo] mentions it in his [1632] book [/ [Dialogue Concerning the Two Chief World Systems]].`[2]` It arises partly from scattering of light inside the eye. This has the effect of enlarging the image of a light area on the retina.",
